<h2 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:{{#if isWarning}}#d97706{{else}}#dc2626{{/if}};">Ingestion {{#if isWarning}}warning{{else}}failed{{/if}}</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">A QTIP data ingestion {{#if isWarning}}looks anomalous{{else}}failed{{/if}} and needs attention. {{#if isWarning}}It ran but the data is stale or the volume dropped below its expected baseline.{{else}}Until it is resolved, the affected report or feed will be missing its latest data.{{/if}}</p>
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width:100%;margin:0 0 16px 0;border-collapse:collapse;">
  <tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;width:200px;">Severity</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;">{{severityLabel}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">Channel</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;">{{channelLabel}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">Feed / Report</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;">{{name}} (<code>{{code}}</code>)</td></tr>
  {{#if source}}<tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">Source</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;">{{source}}</td></tr>{{/if}}
  <tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">Detected at</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-size:13px;">{{formatDateTime occurredAt}}</td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:13px;color:#334155;"><strong>Reason:</strong> {{reason}}</p>
{{> button url=(appUrl deepLinkPath) label="Open Ingestion Log" }}
<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">Open the Ingestion Log to see the full run history. For an email pickup you can re-send the file or use Manual Upload; for a report ingestion, use Run now on Report Schedules once the cause is fixed.</p>
